      "analysis": "Angel's Cold War drama. Jeff Daniels as Reagan opposite Jared Harris' Gorbachev during the 1986 Reykjavik summit, with J.K. Simmons and Hope Davis. Carries a modest $3M–$5M long-range call from Box Office Pro, unchanged since tracking began. It's the only new wide entry that weekend not chasing a dinosaur; Angel's faith-and-family-adjacent audience (Sound of Freedom, Cabrini) gives it a built-in floor, though awards-adjacent political drama has a thinner theatrical track record than the studio's usual fare.",
